===== GPIO =====
==== LEDs ====
Read: [[docs:guide-user:base-system:led_configuration|System configuration: Leds]] to configure the leds
^ Pin   ^ Event       ^ Active   ^
| 4     | power       | Low      |
| 8     | stop        | Low      |
| 11    | inet        | Low      |
| 2     | inet-fail   | Low      |
| 3     | ppp         | Low      |
| 5     | ppp-fail    | Low      |
| 6     | 3g          | Low      |
| 7     | 3g-fail     | Low      |
| 9     | wlan        | Low      |
| 10    | wlan-fail   | Low      |
| 31    | eth         | Low      |
| 20    | eth-fail    | Low      |

==== Buttons ====
-> [[docs:guide-user:hardware:hardware.button]] on howto use and configure the hardware button(s).
^ Pin   ^ Event   ^ Active   ^
| 23    | reset   | Low      |
| 24    | wlan    | Low      |



